{"version":1,"content":"<p>上午11時許，警方接報一名女子在荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓對開疑被墜下的樹枝壓中，女事主頭部受傷，半清醒由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院。</p><p>墜下的樹枝約6米長，直徑5厘米，相信從離地約20米高的大樹上，突然折斷跌落行人路。</p><p>消防到場升起雲梯，協助移除其餘有危險樹枝。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:46.756334+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T05:50:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:38:53.237300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.793640+00:00","content_hash":"99dd043bbf4da917e1e1a5ba0754f845ec9f2da5db7e0fcd5546c739aaf7d1cd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}